{"id":"en_too-late-for-tears","title":"Too Late For Tears","titleEn":"Too Late For Tears","description":"She grew up as the daughter of an AI professor, yet she was never the child her mother had hoped for. In place of the bond she craved, her mother built Chloe, an artificial sister meant to watch over her. Whenever she reached out in distress, Chloe branded her a liar, and her mother sided with the machine every time. Only now does the truth come to light: the daughter her mother lost was the very one she had refused to believe. The question that remains is whether a mother's trust in a machine can ever mend the daughter it helped break.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/too-late-for-tears/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/too-late-for-tears/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family Bonds","Karma","Karma Payback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbtmq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_too-late-for-tears_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbtmq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_too-late-for-tears_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbtmq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_too-late-for-tears_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbtmq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_too-late-for-tears_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbtmq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}